      "statement": "The /chat WebSocket first exchanges a session id, admitting a new chat only with the access code when one is configured, then for each user message streams status, the runtime's frames, a provenance frame and done; messages over 10,000 characters are rejected, an idle-expired session is closed with 4408, and a new_chat message clears the conversation history.",
